Error [E0725]: `replay_turn` is `#Replayable` but reaches `Io`
  --> tests/ui/replayable_reaches_io.jet:7:1
    |
  7 | #Replayable fn replay_turn() {
    | ^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: `#Replayable` code must replay from explicit inputs; ambient time, randomness, network, or console IO would make the same replay diverge
 Fix: inject a deterministic clock/RNG or mockable capability, pass recorded data in, or move the ambient effect outside the replayable function
